e your ideal workstation using more than 135 interchangeable components:\nModular wall, floor, and roof panels to build different configurations.\nScrew-based connectors for assembling and expanding your station.\nSliding protective panels to help contain paint overspray.\nPaint racks, drawers, brush holders, and storage accessories to keep your tools organized.\nRotating painting platform for easier access to your projects.\nAirbrush accessories and equipment holders for a more practical workspace.\nSci-Fi and Fantasy designs to personalize the appearance of your station.\n## DESIGNED FOR 3D PRINTING\nAll components are provided as digital STL files, allowing you to print your own station, choose your configuration, and expand it over time.\nFrom a compact painting corner to a larger modular workstation, you're in control of your workspace!\nOne system. Endless configurations. Your workspace, your way.\n## Core Set\n## Accessories\n## Extra Set\n## Upgrade Set\n## How to use STL parts\n## Stretch Goals","story_images":["https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/055/764/286/ad7f5b5d9c71635e1028c2ed8c561af5_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&origin=ugc&q=92&v=1793724393&width=700&sig=EmYrP9ZKwO2rF%2B7wzgv3%2BPFAUe8QZTzMV%2B1oIdWi5V8%3D","https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/055/954/266/3e57117e8e65197c17c12903f282d888_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&origin=ugc&q=92&v=1795116972&width=700&sig=hJ7jIEL%2BVBnwWF7Oiw3Yo6hH1YJSdMgOLLzTFLea48g%3D","https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/055/859/622/4cde30ce4faee39c91114356d9260c72_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&origin=ugc&q=92&v=1794410839&width=700&sig=%2FRZX4gATUZq9%2FQVtpWOkCxzh%2B6pImcPbJl5Q0YLdiII%3D","https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/055/764/666/1c50c880336095fa87067a58153346d8_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&origin=ugc&q=92&v=1793726160&width=700&sig=NHPxmcDOFV0QGmV8bxNLqoij0KdSrPyBWoaIIaEs100%3D","https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/055/775/511/da745dbd2ad70fb41fc049dca01e5087_original.jpg?fit=scale-down&origin=ugc&q=92&v=1793802323&width=700&sig=sZeJpIZy